Python dependencies
-------------------

Runtime Python dependencies are declared in requirements.txt and pinned in
requirements.lock, and are installed from PyPI rather than redistributed
here. Each retains its own license. The notable copyleft-adjacent ones
are psycopg2-binary (LGPL-3.0, with exceptions) and frozendict
(LGPL-3.0, pulled in by yfinance). Both are used unmodified and loaded
dynamically, so their terms do not propagate to this work.
